From 633c3676ab6c91e9783a7f6eff5d1b4273748e62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Magnus Lindholm <linmag7@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:25:03 +0200
Subject: [RFC PATCH 11/16] sparc64: add one bounded Oberon rearm generation

Require successful source clear and masked acknowledgment before one
explicit rearm. Retain the original record, finish its timer and report,
and publish a fresh record under the IRQ descriptor lock. Recheck source
status, disabled IMAP and idle ICLR before enabling the observed route.

Start a five-second deadline before enabling delivery. Capture masks the
route; expiry masks it without clearing or acknowledging an event. Keep
this experiment default-off and limited to the observed CPU-0 route.

Signed-off-by: Magnus Lindholm <linmag7@gmail.com>
---
