 arch/sparc/kernel/irq_64.c      | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 arch/sparc/kernel/pci_fire.c    | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

